"и Linux x86_64 (`257addee0 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/257addee0>`__). Сборка для Windows поставляется со встроенным"
" CPython, включающим python-lsp-server 1.12.0, jedi 0.17.2, "
"docstring_to_markdown 0.15, pip 24.2 и distlib 0.3.9 (`9b6434602 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/9b6434602>`__, `069807cd3 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/069807cd3>`__, `5f2e45196 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/5f2e45196>`__, `3b6c6c312 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/3b6c6c312>`__)."

